<!--
Merge these two keys into the <dict> of BOTH macos/Runner/DebugProfile.entitlements
and macos/Runner/Release.entitlements after `flutter create . --platforms=macos`.
macOS's App Sandbox (which the default Flutter macOS template enables via
com.apple.security.app-sandbox) blocks outgoing network calls and file access
unless explicitly entitled — without these two keys, Petal will build fine
but silently fail to reach lrclib.net/Drive/OneDrive and fail to open the
file_picker dialog on macOS specifically (other platforms aren't sandboxed
this way, so this is a macOS-only gotcha).
-->
<key>com.apple.security.network.client</key>
<true/>
<key>com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-only</key>
<true/>
